        `date registered` IS YMD 2019 3 1
        `date deregistered` IS NOTHING
        `registered charitable purposes` IS LIST "to advance education in Jersey"
        `registered public benefit statement` IS "Free schooling for children in Jersey"
        `Order under Article 28` IS `Int fx no Order under Article 28`
        `Order under Article 13(9)` IS NOTHING
        `relief Orders under Article 13(10)` IS EMPTY
        `facts for the items of Article 8(3)` IS (`the register entry of the school company`)'s `facts for the items of Article 8(3)`
        `facts for the items of Article 8(5)` IS (`the register entry of the school company`)'s `facts for the items of Article 8(5)`
        `facts for the public elements` IS (`the register entry of the school company`)'s `facts for the public elements`
        `facts for the principal address` IS (`the register entry of the school company`)'s `facts for the principal address`
        `notices served` IS LIST (`Int fx a required steps notice for misconduct sent on` `the registered charity` (YMD 2026 1 10))

#ASSERT `the same items` (LIST `a note of the status of the entity`, `the names of each of the governors`, `the principal address`, `the registered charitable purposes`, `the registered public benefit statement`, `the date on which the charity was registered`, `whether the charity has or has not sent its annual return for the most recent year`, `a note of a required steps notice and of the date on which it was served`) ((`Int (b) is the entity a registered charity and what does the register hold` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the register entry of the school company with a notice`)'s `the entries the Commissioner must enter`)

